{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "ba22a9f266ee0efcff0baf31884e00f3ace21a9d294733c9532f0595b1c45c2c", "ja": "忘れないで、大切な人のことを", "zh": "请不要忘记，重要的人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "38cff477ddcbda1a01d07a97f67b06436d5e842cd9720f285866ecd84e572162", "ja": "片や己が信念を貫き通すため、片や己が信念\nを守るため、ロコ、貴音、千早、千鶴、静香\nがアリーナにて命を燃やす。戦い向きの力を\n持たないロコはペンの力で静観していた先生\nの心を動かし、圧倒的不利な戦局を覆した。", "zh": "一方是为了贯彻自己的信念，另一方是为了守护自己的信念，ROCO、贵音、千早、千鹤、静香在竞技场上燃烧着生命。没有战斗方面力量的ROCO，以笔的力量打动了静观战局的老师的内心，扭转了压倒性不利的战局。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1000_audience", "source_sha256": "70ad5d6ed77ec0f263a405d8ea8f3cd38cdfc27915940de10347c6ff6297b80f", "ja": "ワアアアァァァーッ！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1001_mc", "source_sha256": "5d32089ed7cbd41851fced45504e55895f69262657207817efe394488287836b", "ja": "さあ、今夜も熱狂の時間が始まるぞ！　アリ―ナには\n5人の精鋭の姿……どんな戦いになるのか！？", "zh": "来吧，今晚的狂热时刻也要开始了！竞技场中出现了5名精锐……究竟会展开怎样的战斗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "27c89ef2062115ea2cd1e712d0d97aeb923cd4ab95e61087c868a904c8cb66b8", "ja": "う、うぅ……ティーチャー！　この戦いは、\nキャンセルできないんですか！？", "zh": "呜、呜呜……老师！这场战斗，\n就不能取消吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1003_sensei", "source_sha256": "aedf3226f0de567e7dbf90475494884a11150f369a2ce945ef29d08fe329af6d", "ja": "それは難しい相談だな……島は常に飢えているから。\n一度戦いが始まれば、逃がしてはくれないんだ。", "zh": "这可真是个难办的请求啊……因为岛一直都处于饥饿状态。\n一旦战斗开始，它就不会让你逃走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "fcdf244850ef7bc0b68d1ef3f4a9530c1641e9e0a6f5ec83965de1c546e8ed70", "ja": "そんな、困ります、私……\n絶対……絶対に、忘れてはいけないことがあるのに！", "zh": "这样不行，我……\n\n绝对……绝对有一件不能忘记的事啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "f4d338cc5ac7166f2535feccd3f2a32ecd0ec20caa3dda43df7d64e1adbe0c5b", "ja": "出でよ、『蒼古の巻』！　はあっ！", "zh": "现身吧，《苍古之卷》！哈啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1006_se", "source_sha256": "19ad52b787814194a7703bfdf58fde5dab74c9744b784897d2ea4cd6fd8ef898", "ja": "シュル、シュルルル……ビシッ！", "zh": "嗖、嗖嗖嗖……啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "9ad46ecb3a3d5761917fcf230db88c0551b04ea90439ec054257f9911a1ca23a", "ja": "っ！\n四条さん……ふふ、容赦ないわね。", "zh": "啊！\n四条同学……呵呵，还真是一点都不留情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "df9f692fa558b52442bd9c556bdccbb673c1921cda7f5a5d1afe48170ffcf30a", "ja": "タカネの巻物が、チハヤに巻き付いて……！\nた、戦うんですか、タカネ！？", "zh": "贵音的卷轴缠住千早了……！\n要、要战斗吗，贵音！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "621ab42c9606479e5acb79dc0f88072043cb1c320c09bf1ffb27259dca03eef4", "ja": "他に選択肢がないのです、みちこ……\n千早に先に動かれたら、私たちは負けます。", "zh": "没有其他选择了，美智子……  \n要是千早先出手，我们就会输。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "016ce16e912c80e525fb2e3535fe73f209eba083c21094d416aba64eaa3b9b16", "ja": "戦具同士の戦いになれば、彼女は無敵……\n先に封じるしか、手はありません！", "zh": "一旦陷入战斗，她就是无敌的……\n只能先将她封印起来，别无他法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1011_mc", "source_sha256": "1e7384c676e6f25679dc6bd49139e39b8fdef674388281d2f079f3ca8d32e810", "ja": "おーっと、コール前に始まってしまった！\n出遅れてしまったが……シャドウバウト、エンゲージ！", "zh": "哎呀，竟然在喊口号之前就开始了！  \n虽然慢了一拍……暗影对战，开始交战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1012_audience", "source_sha256": "70ad5d6ed77ec0f263a405d8ea8f3cd38cdfc27915940de10347c6ff6297b80f", "ja": "ワアアアァァァーッ！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "4a770ae15fedfc83918b8cd7a75d3bb912bb66147e1f6f0d11c04cfd68f7fee6", "ja": "四条さん、貴女の巻物は本来、戦闘向きの\n能力ではないわ。こんなもの、すぐに……", "zh": "四条，你的卷轴本就不是用于战斗的\n能力。这种东西，马上就会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1014_se", "source_sha256": "9959333f3c90c18be349a63fdacf5e9f3de2fdd485e51a3287e35eae7ae8a546", "ja": "ピシッ、バリッ、ビリビリッ……！", "zh": "啪、咔、噼里啪啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "91de1bee1ae336d71b31b1f5645de45b2839b5be17e938b7a17249e42b363da0", "ja": "くっ……そう長くはもちません……\n早く！　今のうちに、畳みかけてください！", "zh": "呃……撑不了多久了……\n快！趁现在，继续猛攻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "3a2c07cb6fd1f8895a872ad45a9f754eba1b9faa292c60664330c8c6a3c9599f", "ja": "戦いが早く終われば、大忘却は\n起こらないかもしれないのです！　だから……早く！", "zh": "如果战斗能尽快结束，大遗忘\n也许就不会发生了！所以……快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "23b8abe4b60e14bbce1a8a9233ab04888651e2d66dd2cb10220903fcbaf0c8d0", "ja": "先手必勝、というわけですわね……いいですわ！\nわたくしの戦具、見せて差し上げます。", "zh": "所谓先发制人，对吧……很好！\n就让你们看看我的战斗装备吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "3452de071f3fb38b099fafbc11bce3ddbf478cae0357e4ffe26eadf892bcc08f", "ja": "黄金の輝きを、今、わたくしの手に……\nこのバトル、プライスレスですわ！", "zh": "黄金的光辉，如今就在我的手中……\n这场战斗无价！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1019_se", "source_sha256": "467ed8a9fc9ee8d3d34b438cf3112e38b47d2702867d44bc7b4c872cf3269d66", "ja": "シュピッ！", "zh": "咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "f3b28d807673daa9b99bfcb11a76b3a7096b44dde9db057c4a8232f7271fa2f6", "ja": "で、出たー！　チヅルの『ムーンゴールド・カード』！\nファビュラスにしてゴージャスな、その能力は……", "zh": "出、出现了——！千鹤的『月之黄金卡』！  \n既华丽又奢华的能力是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "d9d1ebf5bd96dda160b7deea864487d4b410b5836e38bb209ed4c3a94e10d0fc", "ja": "コロちゃん、解説はいいから下がってくださいまし！\nあなたのペンも、戦闘向きではないのですから！", "zh": "CORO，解说就免了，请退到后面去！你的笔也不是战斗用的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "c50c3bf23f7d7a243613df5d2e5badda566c726ebdaf747850146aca8976e1f9", "ja": "はっ！　ジャーナリストのソウルが、つい……。\nわかりました、ロコはすみっこにいます！", "zh": "啊！记者之魂一不小心就……  \n明白了，ROCO待在角落里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "8156128e829ccbe76019ab34248c1b49c5d0ac9f0819ce30528de1e675d45b27", "ja": "さて……では、静香に格闘用のメタルグローブと、\nわたくしに拳銃を……支払いは一括で！", "zh": "那么……接下来，给静香一副格斗用的金属手套，再给我一把手枪……付款一次付清！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1024_se", "source_sha256": "cae43bdab7f9c41a7f7cb7adb46abefd49a79b496bb9fa39150af8c799f569c5", "ja": "ヴンッ！　ガチャ、ガチャッ！", "zh": "嗡！咔哒、咔哒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "4d73ed376ba21f5259057e480b782e260bb8c5a93854c4b94b787a45a3f84d8c", "ja": "お金で買えるものを、即座に取り寄せる能力、\nだったわね。確かに強力な戦具だわ。でも……。", "zh": "用钱就能买到的东西，立刻召唤过来的能力，\n对吧。确实是很强力的战斗装备。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1026_se", "source_sha256": "2ac39c94892ce7e83c7083008cfe4d8b5198c7f399c78f337224df0ae5b04904", "ja": "ビリッ、ビリビリビリッ！", "zh": "撕拉、撕拉撕拉撕拉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1027_008tak", "source_sha256": "d49e5e30ffcec4e25195336d11df447010e8530c7a6c09478355462a4fc41fe9", "ja": "あ、ああっ！？　私の巻物が……！", "zh": "啊、啊啊！？我的卷轴……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "1c93d88c334fa57b0df081efe17449eab756ef26109525b71d3757f76f3f0528", "ja": "開け、『青い鳥籠』……\n夢見た空は遠くにあって、誰もそこへは届かない……", "zh": "打开吧，《蓝色鸟笼》……梦中的天空就在远方，谁也无法抵达那里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1029_se", "source_sha256": "de605174c03c1d2e9a3db25991f766bb093aa292c6aa693b16c617506c28df9d", "ja": "ガチャ、キイィ……\n……ヴンッ！", "zh": "咔嗒、吱呀……\n……嗡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1030_038chz", "source_sha256": "add2ba8c108d6bd1f16241d7715504182e4c6c0e9a5a8a4b98d8cdf6c2d00d7c", "ja": "ぐっ！？　こ、この圧力……これほどとは……！\n静香、こんな中でよく動けますわね！？", "zh": "唔！？这、这股压力……竟然强到这种程度……！\n静香，你居然能在这种地方自由行动！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "15936aa2e0a5c889b34f433dc108ce565fec655f0e269b008cafd04f89cc39fb", "ja": "鍛えていますから。グローブ、ありがとうございます。\nこれで全力で行けます……はあっ！", "zh": "因为我一直在锻炼。谢谢你的手套。这样就能全力以赴了……哈啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1032_038chz", "source_sha256": "b9bc7a7c51b26917be164c31ccb0f2132952815b796a4a96234d573533f34e13", "ja": "サポートしますわ！　くっ、腕が重いですわね……\nよく狙って……", "zh": "我来支援您！唔，手臂真沉啊……\n仔细瞄准……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1033_se", "source_sha256": "7be0a663d40726523609a26facbffb0977b4bdf7cc0b27910b27ed2351091b8d", "ja": "ダダダダダダンッ！", "zh": "哒哒哒哒哒哒——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "a28d0a17dc8fbfafe4433035d670394151e417f6580900cc99d9397eb3f59676", "ja": "うりゃあーっ！", "zh": "喝啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1035_se", "source_sha256": "3fcab95ec4518f112d028aa83be0203886f8a1822ed82d9a347212c5b5643625", "ja": "ヒュッ……ドゴォッ！", "zh": "咻……咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "a03844d059608d2ec7448f660af79d08046bc0e72573abc38c24a501656c0b5d", "ja": "……っ！？\nなんですって……まったく効いていない！？", "zh": "……！？\n怎么会……居然完全不起作用！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1037_038chz", "source_sha256": "8ad242b5091675c35fb044c0acdd209fc73558a5e5d4c19b8e5ed8d7962da76a", "ja": "見えない障壁が、千早を取り囲んでいますわ……\nですが、弾丸までも弾いてしまうなんて！", "zh": "一道看不见的屏障将千早团团围住……没想到连子弹都能弹开！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1038_002chi", "source_sha256": "9b8caf7725fe8e67e56125b26a1c78e8bdafbb5fc1da9d7f9b2d18ef972580ae", "ja": "鳥籠は、閉じ込めるだけのものではない……\n中にいる者を、守るものでもあるの。", "zh": "鸟笼并不只是用来囚禁人的……\n它也能保护里面的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1039_002chi", "source_sha256": "b8d4bd7542a6286f5b437c69a73a6413ea13404d2218075966819ef0b15ed5fd", "ja": "防戦こそが、私の真骨頂よ。\n後はこのまま、大忘却が起きるまで耐えてみせる。", "zh": "防守才是我的拿手好戏。接下来就这样坚持到大遗忘发生为止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1040_008tak", "source_sha256": "9e5a051f28b6c2ec76117c9a05c531bfc19249aa84b961688b69a9874ec56c6e", "ja": "くっ……！\nこれではもう、成す術が……。", "zh": "呃……！\n这样下去已经无计可施了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1041_025roc", "source_sha256": "5d8391efc4723581a33eb6394eb07e4c090154eac515cc471bf41ecabdb66fbd", "ja": "ど、どうしたら……このままでは、\n大忘却が起こってしまいます……！", "zh": "该、该怎么办才好……这样下去，大遗忘就要发生了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1042_025roc", "source_sha256": "0a904c2d4c2466a6dbe89d210bc719cf9d997c878b98e0d08f6ef30686938a9f", "ja": "チヅルやシズカ、そしてタカネと出会ったこと……\n全部忘れてしまうなんて、ロコは絶対にイヤです！", "zh": "连千鹤、静香，还有贵音都见过了……竟然要把这一切全部忘掉，ROCO绝对不要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1043_025roc", "source_sha256": "74f9a7217c38f40c367bab118f0a73cf08a8e512183b05dc7178b1fb74ca5be7", "ja": "こうなったら……\nカモンです、『キャプションペン』！", "zh": "既然这样……出来吧，《Caption Pen》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1044_se", "source_sha256": "8658297d3b5f8d5928cbfe14de51b9ef92f740b7b55516ec16a26ddcec524405", "ja": "スチャッ", "zh": "唰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1045_025roc", "source_sha256": "85be4b3a9ef74c081576ebc45520b3b5d3dbb8bb25860445e8c0076c6e22f982", "ja": "この戦具は、大したパワーも、使い道もありません。\nでも……ノットバットです。", "zh": "这件战斗装备，既没有多大的力量，也没什么用处。不过……也不算太差。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1046_025roc", "source_sha256": "cafe93ac67dba49b616b1a00c7599aa109a57d7bee46b2ad3185f91c1442f9e3", "ja": "ロコは、ロコらしく……最後までストラグルです！\n『忘れないで、大切な人のことを』！", "zh": "ROCO要有ROCO的风格……就要奋斗到最后！“不要忘记重要的人！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1047_002chi", "source_sha256": "30e672a19bcf2d8b31ed53099fd8f3b0651c500bbfa4f35e071632bc577e165b", "ja": "……っ！？　なに、頭の中に、文字が……？", "zh": "……！？什么，脑海里出现了文字……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1048_038chz", "source_sha256": "a0fdad04cd3bfc1bae2b9f549ef9943cd26c2994176cc7552af00ca6b63720c9", "ja": "コロちゃんの戦具ですわね！　たった一文、\n新聞の見出し程度の文章を、他人に共有する能力。", "zh": "这是CORO的战斗装备吧！能将短短一句、相当于报纸标题长度的文字分享给他人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1049_015siz", "source_sha256": "89cafd366490b86537e09610c6caddbeef2ea2369203cbfcb86d5c3e843f78d5", "ja": "力は弱いけど、その範囲は島全土に及ぶほどの\n広域……ロコらしい能力ですね。", "zh": "虽然力量不强，但范围却广到覆盖整座岛屿，是广域……ROCO式的能力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1050_008tak", "source_sha256": "711904146aa4fa50ab7abc79a9d10819cbffbaf6e6c5ebf8a629dd5f2daee08f", "ja": "みちこ……これが、貴女の戦いなのですね。", "zh": "路子……这就是，你的战斗方式吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1051_002chi", "source_sha256": "7e57cc5bd0312a8d487ed1356a84c320c5daecc0c25fa583fcfd72364289d43c", "ja": "……だから、何？　たった一文、\n思考を送り込まれたところで、何の意味が……。", "zh": "……那又如何？只不过是被送进了一句话的\n思绪，又能有什么意义……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1052_se", "source_sha256": "1f08ac80162720f7b83ac711862b4c0756576841a7f6a2c53ce54e58ecc6c976", "ja": "……カッ！　ドドォンッ！！！！", "zh": "……轰！咚隆隆隆！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1053_015siz", "source_sha256": "d801d495eb65354bd2bb468946d7b2e5f7a3b13770a31f5f94a02889200e432c", "ja": "きゃあっ！？　な、なに……急に落雷？", "zh": "呀！？怎、怎么回事……突然打雷了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1054_002chi", "source_sha256": "58eaf672bf90ff434c50d9f898e7d01282126a60dd0c659b2fe88fa3394dc43c", "ja": "っ！？　これは……雷撃法！\nどういうつもりなの……先生！", "zh": "！？这是……雷击术！\n你到底想干什么……老师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1055_sensei", "source_sha256": "d31dc4823c6456f2b546d22c99de284eb318915d1e722f96b9bff39b49529219", "ja": "……参ったな。俺まで影響を受けるとは。\nそれは大した戦具だよ、ロコ。", "zh": "……真拿你没办法。居然连我也受到了影响。\n那真是一件了不起的战具啊，ROCO。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1056_sensei", "source_sha256": "f926c57276ac02ba6f4f188fbc4c496492331f19b5e12000369a86dc0a5b3723", "ja": "お陰で……ずっと忘れてたことを、思い出せた。", "zh": "多亏了你……我想起了那件一直忘记的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1057_002chi", "source_sha256": "6edde03658a62aa065b00ac304e5c43f204cd7526517686f6e981b53c9fc1760", "ja": "……。\n裏切るつもりですか？　先生。", "zh": "……\n您打算背叛吗？老师。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1058_sensei", "source_sha256": "76f74ff1c3cf048459d54fd0154efa18d957044ebb4172974ace0fad1972171f", "ja": "違うよ。こうすることが、\nきっとみんなのためになる。そう信じているだけだ。", "zh": "不是的。只是我相信，这样做一定会对大家有帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1059_sensei", "source_sha256": "eed6943d1d2579dd439f0c554e81fd0ae5abd8567eced9bebd32d00a5c305e5e", "ja": "もちろん、千早の為にもな！", "zh": "当然，也是为了千早嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1060_002chi", "source_sha256": "5edaaa2c73062cd3c02df240aca480143e3f57d41c27f4194452dfa8838c9e9d", "ja": "……っ。\n木偶人形風情が、利いた風な口を。", "zh": "……！\n一个木偶而已，居然还敢说这种自以为是的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1061_sensei", "source_sha256": "b27ae450306e90f320bd1f4defcd77c088f8a4d03d3baa3269ad4cbbfe82fffc", "ja": "空っぽの人形に、魂が宿る……\nそんな可能性も、ゼロとは言えないのかもな。", "zh": "空空如也的人偶里寄宿着灵魂……\n这种可能性，也不能说完全不存在吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1062_sensei", "source_sha256": "dbab69b9809396c7658775f372b88e47e92385026d539ee2d0d8821f96156bee", "ja": "みんなが、泣いて笑って輝いて……。\nその輝きこそが世界だったって、思い出したんだ。", "zh": "大家哭过、笑过、闪耀着……\n我想起来了，那份光芒，正是整个世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1063_008tak", "source_sha256": "d22e255954dfa31ff5ac3de420f61d8a63bc66f63cf28b9c554bd89e5ad95945", "ja": "先生……。", "zh": "老师……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1064_sensei", "source_sha256": "141c07fde30f9349cf3bf6455621347965116e013023dc317928e7253be1ea4e", "ja": "みんな、後は任せたぞ……\n雷霆よ、悉く来たれ！　夜を貫き暁光となれ！！", "zh": "大家，接下来就拜托你们了……\n\n雷霆啊，尽数降临吧！贯穿黑夜，化作破晓之光！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_06_1065_null", "source_sha256": "febaafb138d245edb9a97e6dd267325b762306045083182f7e21af2164924276", "ja": "……カッ！！！！！", "zh": "……咔！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
